MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1384873977}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 8f391295820dc5e408d3f1a3956032dc, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  CharacterSpeakingBox: {fileID: 1938303093}
  Ghost: {fileID: 1075904235}
  disableTorchCollider: 0
  startPlayerHealth: 0
  dialogueList:
  - 'Hey you!


    Come here!'
  - 'You need to get inside as soon as possible!!

    That green gas over there
    is sleepy gas and it is poisonous to the non-ghosts of this world! If you go
    to bed, you won''t be affected by it.'
  - If you can find key the to my house, you can go inside and sleep before the gas
    affects you! I The key is found in a blue chest but I've forgot where the chest
    is so you are going to have to be quick and find it yourself!
  - 'My house is somewhere nearby too so hopefully you''ll be able to find it! There
    are also blue pears around and if you eat them you will be given a health boost! '
  - Just stand on the pears to grab them and eat them. Now go quick before the gas
    poisons you - Good Luck!!!!
